<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Care Areas — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fcfaf6;--accent:#7a4f3a;--muted:#5f5751;--card:#fff;--accent-2:#b67e53;--radius:12px;--maxw:980px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f0e7dd);color:#2b2622}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);backdrop-filter: blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(43,37,33,0.04)}
    .nav{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:20px}
    h1{margin:4px 0 6px 0}
    .intro{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(30,24,20,0.04)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}
    .list{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .condition{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fdfaf8);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    .condition h3{margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .disclaimer{background:#fff3f0;border-left:4px solid rgba(182,126,103,0.9);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:#6b2f24}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 420ms ease,transform 420ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:none}
    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:30px auto;padding:16px;color:var(--muted)}
    .try{margin-top:12px}
    @media (max-width:920px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class='nav'>
      <div class='brand'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style='margin-left:12px;display:flex;gap:8px'>
        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
        <a href='services.html'>Offerings</a>
        <a href='conditions.html' aria-current='page'>Care Areas</a>
        <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
        <a href='about.html'>Team</a>
        <a href='contact.html' style='margin-left:auto'>Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class='intro reveal'>
      <h1>Conditions and supportive framing</h1>
      <p class='meta'>We provide educational, supportive strategies that can complement medical care. We do not promise cures; instead we offer structured ways to reduce symptom burden and improve daily function, in partnership with your clinicians.</p>
    </section>

    <div class='grid'>
      <div>
        <section class='list reveal' id='conditionsList'>
          <div class='condition'>
            <h3>Chronic Fatigue & Low Energy</h3>
            <p class='meta'>Practical sequencing: sleep stability, circadian supports, selective labs, small-step activity plans.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='condition'>
            <h3>Digestive Disturbance</h3>
            <p class='meta'>Focus on food patterns, gentle elimination trials, stress-linked motility strategies, and referral when alarm features exist.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='condition'>
            <h3>Stress-Reactive Conditions</h3>
            <p class='meta'>Breathwork, micro-habits, sleep prioritization, and pragmatic cognitive techniques to reduce reactivity.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='condition'>
            <h3>Hormonal Transition Support</h3>
            <p class='meta'>Lifestyle and nutritional framing to manage perimenopause, thyroid shifts, and metabolic changes with measurable steps.</p>
          </div>
          <div class='condition'>
            <h3>Chronic Pain (non-acute)</h3>
            <p class='meta'>Biopsychosocial approaches: pacing, movement exposure, sleep, nutrition, and coordinated care with providers.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class='reveal' id='ctaBox' style='margin-top:18px'>
          <div class='disclaimer'>
            Important: the information here is educational and supportive. It is not a substitute for medical advice. If you have new, worsening, or urgent symptoms, please seek immediate medical care or contact your primary clinician.
          </div>
          <div class='try'>
            <button class='btn btn-primary' id='tryNowBtn'>Try a brief practice</button>
            <a class='btn btn-alt' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='margin-left:8px'>Book a focused review</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class='reveal' style='margin-top:18px'>
          <h2>How we support common journeys</h2>
          <p class='meta'>We start with a short evaluation to clarify safety, prioritize testing, and build a phased plan. Plans emphasize brief wins and durable routines; they are designed to be communicated to your wider care team.</p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <aside class='reveal' style='background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;align-self:start'>
        <h3 style='margin-top:0'>When to consider our services</h3>
        <ul style='color:var(--muted)'>
          <li>Ongoing symptoms that affect daily function</li>
          <li>Desire to reduce medication burden with a clinician-informed plan</li>
          <li>Need for a clear, short-term roadmap</li>
        </ul>
        <div style='margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)'>We always review safety concerns and coordinate recommendations when needed.</div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class='reveal' style='margin-top:22px'>
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>Will you stop my medications?</summary>
        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>We do not arbitrarily stop medications. Any change is coordinated with prescribing clinicians and done cautiously with monitoring plans.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you provide lab orders?</summary>
        <div style='color:var(--muted)'>When indicated and appropriate, we may suggest targeted testing. We ensure tests are purposeful and paired with clear interpretation.</div>
      </details>
    </section>

  </main>
  <footer>
    <div style='max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px;color:var(--muted)'>
      <div>Questions? <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}' style='text-decoration:underline;color:inherit'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
